## Title-zhTW: Getrich 賺錢助手
## Notes: Money-making helper for WoW Forever: AH-to-vendor flips, crafting profit and skill-up planning, disenchanting, price history, Waylaid Crates and Craftsman's Writs.
## Notes-zhCN: 魔兽世界 Forever 挣钱助手：拍卖行低于卖店价的倒卖、制造利润和冲技能规划、附魔分解、价格走势、Waylaid Crate 和 Craftsman's Writ。
## Notes-zhTW: 魔獸世界 Forever 賺錢助手：拍賣場低於賣店價的倒賣、製造利潤和衝技能規劃、附魔分解、價格走勢、Waylaid Crate 和 Craftsman's Writ。
